Z||000003||MinnGreenGT||08-06-2001||02:55 PM||||I'm currently in the process of adapting one from a Izuzu VehiCross.  I paid about $85 for the basic parts, and I'm going to try to mate it directly to the "cup" insert currently on all Fieros (I had a spare).  If it works, it should be nearly a bolt-in item. The only cosmetic change I forsee is the round opening needs to be opened up a little more (maybe 1/4"). I'll try to get going on it and let you know what I come up with!<P>-Rob<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngt.jpg">  <P>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
